[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969052476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2969052476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2969052476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w-CU8","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T05:07:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T05:07:05Z","body":"I'll probably do the same in 3.x. I've long thought these implicit conversions were a bad idea especially for heavy types, and I'm sure it will expose some performance bugs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969052476/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969479003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2969479003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2969479003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w_qdb","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T08:09:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T08:09:44Z","body":"I think this might warrant proper review of each occurrence, as it might highlight that some stuff uses `LocalVector` when it shouldn't. My understanding is that `LocalVector` was meant to be _local_ and not passed across method boundaries, which typically use `Vector`. Here it looks like we have code that creates `LocalVector` only to convert it to `Vector` whenever it's passed to a method, which seems wasteful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969479003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969508350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2969508350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2969508350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w_xn-","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T08:21:35Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T08:25:41Z","body":"> I think this might warrant proper review of each occurrence, as it might highlight that some stuff uses `LocalVector` when it shouldn't. \r\n\r\nAgreed, but unfortunately the fixes might not be fully straight-forward. For example, we had [a PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105264) recently that optimized by using `LocalVector` temporarily and converting to `Vector` only at the end, because the `Vector` creation overhead is so large. For example, `Vector` does not retain its buffer on `clear()` ([yet](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105928)), which can lead to frequent re-allocations during growth.\r\nI'm guessing some of the performance problems exposed here might be best resolved by making use of `Span` or `VectorView` instead. \r\n\r\nAll in all, personally I'd still move forwards with this one now, and leave it to contributors of the areas to apply an appropriate fix as a follow-up.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969508350/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973525393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2973525393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2973525393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xPGWR","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T06:07:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T06:07:37Z","body":"BTW something to watch for here which has bit me just now doing conversions from `Vector` to `LocalVector`, that the default `size` is unsigned for `LocalVector` and `signed` for `Vector` (certainly in 3.x, and I *think* in 4.x) so you might have to check the use cases and convert to unsigned, or make sure they are ok with unsigned counters.\r\n\r\nAlternative is to use a `LocalVector<T, int32_t>` instead of `LocalVector<T>`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973525393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974712093","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2974712093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2974712093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xToEd","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T21:57:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T21:57:38Z","body":"> BTW something to watch for here which has bit me just now doing conversions from `Vector` to `LocalVector`, that the default `size` is unsigned for `LocalVector` and `signed` for `Vector` (certainly in 3.x, and I _think_ in 4.x) so you might have to check the use cases and convert to unsigned, or make sure they are ok with unsigned counters.\r\n> \r\n> Alternative is to use a `LocalVector<T, int32_t>` instead of `LocalVector<T>`.\r\n\r\nIn this PR I made no logical changes (just made the conversion explicit), so there should not be any effect on signed-ness of objects' counters.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974712093/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974764486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-2974764486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":2974764486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xT03G","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-15T23:45:18Z","updated_at":"2025-06-15T23:45:18Z","body":"For the rendering changes, this looks fine for now. We need to move to using Span more widely so we use LocalVector even more. In particular, the methods here that are converting to Vector should be modified to take a Span, so a LocalVector can be used instead","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2974764486/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299509954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-3299509954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":3299509954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EqobC","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T16:27:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T16:27:17Z","body":"Needs rebase","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299509954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299990909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-3299990909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107469","id":3299990909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Esd19","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T19:03:52Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T19:03:52Z","body":"Rebased. There are new bad conversion cases (i.e. more reasons to delete the implicit conversion!), but I chose not to optimize them in this PR. It's out of scope since it's also somewhat risky.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299990909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352955623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107469#issuecomment-3352955623","issue_url":"https: